  "workload": "Core 3.0 WASIp1 C reactor, -O3, no EH or threads. Volatile 4 KiB aligned buffer. One indexed word read and write per loop iteration. Matching nonzero static allocation tags checked outside the timed kernel.",
  "clock": "Guest CLOCK_MONOTONIC around the kernel, including initialization. Five order-rotated repetitions with long, quarter-length and zero-loop controls. Ratios are calculated per matching repetition. Triples are inclusive Q1, median and Q3.",
