  "disabled": "The same tagged Wasm as the software and hardware samples, with runtime MTE disabled.",
  "scope": "The five VM executables replay the same four guest modules built by an installed x86_64 compiler. ARM timings measure QEMU TCG throughput. Physical ARM execution and a five-host compiler installation matrix are separate qualifications.",
